{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/style/tokens","title":"Tokens and typed variables","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"tokens-and-typed-variables","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Tokens and typed variables"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Level 1. Useful from the first component, and it does not require anything else"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"in the app to change."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"no-value-is-a-string","children":[{"t":"text","text":"No value is a string"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Every value is a "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"nominal object"}]},{"t":"text","text":", not a branded string:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { bg, p, palette, space, unit } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/style'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"space","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"4","kind":"number"},{"text":")); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// ✅","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"(unit.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"rem","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"1.5","kind":"number"},{"text":")); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// ✅","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'12px'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// ❌ a length is not a string","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"`${","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"4","kind":"number"},{"text":"}px`","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// ❌ not even one of the right shape","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"bg","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'red'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// ❌ a colour is not a keyword","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"(palette.text.strong); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// ❌ a colour is not a length","kind":"comment"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The shape matters more than it looks. With "},{"t":"code","text":"string & { __length?: true }"},{"t":"text","text":" —"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"an "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"optional"}]},{"t":"text","text":" phantom on a primitive base — "},{"t":"code","text":"'blabla'"},{"t":"text","text":" stays assignable, every"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"test stays green, and the guarantee written on this page is false."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-scales-are-closed","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The scales are closed"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"space(7)"},{"t":"text","text":" does not compile. When a step is missing, add it to the scale; there"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"is no "},{"t":"code","text":"[17px]"},{"t":"text","text":" arbitrary-value syntax on purpose."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The one way out is marked:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { unsafeLength } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/style'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"unsafeLength","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'13px'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'aligns with a legacy image'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"It compiles, and it propagates "},{"t":"code","text":"unproven"},{"t":"text","text":" to the dependency graph, where the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"debt is counted. Without this door a blocked agent bypasses the design system"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"entirely; with it unmarked, it bypasses it in silence."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-property-table-is-generated","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The property table is generated"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"477 properties, generated from MDN data — which is what guarantees no keyword"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"was invented. A closed keyword set is a namespace, never a string:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { display, position } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/style'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"display.inlineFlex; ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// ✅","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"display.inlineFlexx; ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// ❌ Property 'inlineFlexx' does not exist","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"position","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'sticky'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// ❌ a keyword is not something you pass in","kind":"comment"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Two consequences worth knowing:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"code","text":"overflow"},{"t":"text","text":" is not in the table."}]},{"t":"text","text":" The only road to "},{"t":"code","text":"overflow-block: auto"},{"t":"text","text":" is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"provides(scrollPort.block)"},{"t":"text","text":" — see "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/style/obligations","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"obligations"}]},{"t":"text","text":". The wrong"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"fix is not discouraged, it cannot be written."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"124 helpers are narrower than CSS."}]},{"t":"text","text":" A grammar alternative the generator"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"cannot close is dropped rather than approximated, so a helper may refuse a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"form CSS would accept. It can never produce CSS a browser rejects. The list is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"exported as "},{"t":"code","text":"NARROWED_PROPERTIES"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A few values the table cannot type on its own have constructors:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"gradient.linear"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":".radial"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":".repeatingLinear"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":".repeatingConic"},{"t":"text","text":", written"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"with "},{"t":"code","text":"bgImage(...)"},{"t":"text","text":" — several images make several layers, and "},{"t":"code","text":"bgSize"},{"t":"text","text":" /"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"bgPosition"},{"t":"text","text":" take one inline and one block value;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"uaScheme.light"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":".dark"},{"t":"text","text":" for "},{"t":"code","text":"color-scheme"},{"t":"text","text":", so native controls follow the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"theme;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"spanAllColumns"},{"t":"text","text":" for "},{"t":"code","text":"grid-column: 1 / -1"},{"t":"text","text":";"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"pseudo.content.attr(ident('data-x'))"},{"t":"text","text":" for a "},{"t":"code","text":"::before"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"::after"},{"t":"text","text":" whose text"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"is an attribute the template writes."}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"typed-custom-properties","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Typed custom properties"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { color, cssVars, kind, p, palette, unit } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/style'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"v"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"cssVars","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'badge'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ink: kind.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"color","kind":"function"},{"text":"(palette.text.strong),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  pad: kind.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"length","kind":"function"},{"text":"(unit.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"px","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"16","kind":"number"},{"text":")),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"color","kind":"function"},{"text":"(v.ink); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// ✅ the token carries its kind's brand","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"(v.ink); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// ❌ a <color> variable is not a length","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"v.ink.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"or","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"space","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"4","kind":"number"},{"text":")); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// ❌ the fallback is typed against the same kind","kind":"comment"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Two rules the browser enforces and the types cannot:"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A registered "},{"t":"code","text":"initial-value"},{"t":"text","text":" must be computationally independent."}]},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"initial-value: 1rem"},{"t":"text","text":" makes the whole "},{"t":"code","text":"@property"},{"t":"text","text":" rule invalid and the browser"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"drops it "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"silently"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — the variable stops being registered, "},{"t":"code","text":"var(--x)"},{"t":"text","text":" resolves to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"nothing, and whatever reads it computes to zero. "},{"t":"code","text":"cssVars"},{"t":"text","text":" refuses a relative"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"unit there and names the fix."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"code","text":"inherits: false"},{"t":"text","text":" is the right default, and wrong for a theme."}]},{"t":"text","text":" A variable an"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"element sets and reads on itself should not inherit: it bounds invalidation. A"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"theme variable is the opposite — set once on a wrapper, read by everything"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"below — so pass "},{"t":"code","text":"{ inherits: true }"},{"t":"text","text":". A non-inheriting theme hands every"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"descendant the initial value, which looks exactly like dark mode not working,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"with no error anywhere."}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"no-value-is-a-string","text":"No value is a string"},{"level":2,"id":"the-scales-are-closed","text":"The scales are closed"},{"level":2,"id":"the-property-table-is-generated","text":"The property table is generated"},{"level":2,"id":"typed-custom-properties","text":"Typed custom properties"}]}